abstract: >-
  NeuroMouse26 is an award-winning open-source Micromouse robotics project built
  on the ESP32-S3. It autonomously explores and solves a 16×16 maze using
  flood-fill BFS, position-PID motion control, infrared wall sensing, and 4×
  quadrature encoder decoding; the robot placed 3rd overall at the 2026 All
  America Micromouse Contest at UCLA IEEE.
